# Citation metadata for ausPH. GitHub's "Cite this repository" button and
# Zenodo's archive of each GitHub release are built from this file.
# Update `version` and `date-released` with each release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ausPH, please cite the version you used. Each release is archived on Zenodo with its own DOI."
type: software
title: "ausPH: Retrieve Data from the Parliamentary Handbook of the Commonwealth of Australia"
abstract: >-
  Retrieves data from the Australian Parliamentary Library's Parliamentary
  Handbook and returns it as tidy tables: members and senators, their
  parliamentary and party service, ministries, shadow ministries, presiding
  officers, committees, parties, electorates, parliaments, sitting dates,
  elections and two candidate preferred results. Known errors in the
  Handbook are flagged, and can optionally be corrected from a documented
  errata table.
authors:
  - family-names: Leslie
    given-names: Pat
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9218-8981"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/palesl/ausPH"
url: "https://github.com/palesl/ausPH"
keywords:
  - Australia
  - parliament
  - Parliamentary Handbook
  - R
